cmd.typed_verify_hint:
This project uses the visual-report format (format 5/7). A Verify cannot be closed with a plain-text close. Use the typed input of the connected gil_close.
  Send these two arguments together with project_root and report (actual execution/result/evidence_files):
  expected_owner: {"kind":"step","ref":"{here}"}
  For document evidence that needs no image, visuals: {"attachments":[],"uses":[],"declaration":{"state":"not_needed","reason":"the actual reason no image is needed"}}
  For a new PNG, write key/path/source_kind/source_description in attachments, source: {"kind":"new","key":"the same attachment key"} with caption/alt/purpose in uses, and close with declaration: {"state":"attached"}. uses stays outside declaration. stored is only for citing an already confirmed owner/asset_id/sha256. The exact JSON for two PNGs is in gil_help topic report/visuals (CLI: gil help visuals). Do not switch the declaration to not_needed to bypass an error or repeat the plain close.

